cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "IRexp, IRSpectra-Bench, and forward-verification for LLM molecular structure elucidation"
abstract: >-
  Open data and code for the manuscript "Recall, not verification, is the bottleneck
  when frontier LLMs elucidate molecular structures from real spectra": the IRexp experimental-IR
  dataset, the blind IRSpectra-Bench benchmark, model predictions, and the
  training-free forward-verification method.
